WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
We've been sleeping together for a few days

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:02,960
After all, it’s considered sleeping together, right?

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,600
Not a couple yet

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,080
Senior loves to tease me

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:11,860
Senior, why are you going to wash the pot? I'll do it.

6
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:13,220
You cook and I wash the pot

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:17,700
I can't let you do everything alone, okay? Then I'll leave it to you. I'll lie down for a while.

8
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,100
My body needs a good sleep

9
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,050
Senior, you slept so soundly

10
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:30,290
I also need to rest quickly

11
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,290
I won't take off my hind legs

12
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:41,570
Senior, morning, morning, morning, morning

13
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:43,250
I slept so softly this morning

14
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:45,090
I feel like I'm sleeping softly
